cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "surveyBurden: Ex-Ante Path-Aware Survey Instrument Burden Assessment"
abstract: >-
  An R package that estimates the response burden of a Qualtrics survey
  instrument before it is fielded. It parses a '.qsf' export (or fetches a
  live survey through the Qualtrics API), reconstructs the respondent paths
  the survey's flow and display logic allow, scores every question with the
  published GfS / Axhausen burden weights, and reports the burden across
  those paths as a structured object.
type: software
